It doesn't matter that a **Ninja** and his comrades go down easily and
by the dozen, or that years of assassin's training count for little.
The work is his whole life, and no odds, however hopeless, will make
him betray it. *Agile +1, Art of Invisibility +2, Attack (Katana) +1,
Quick +1; Code of Conduct (Will Die Before Revealing Information) -3.*

